\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Button</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"返回\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        onPress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => navigation.goBack()}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">View</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>导航方法</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>参数类型安全</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>navigation.navigate(&#39;Screen&#39;, params)</code></td>\n<td>跳转到屏幕（已在栈中则复用）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>navigation.push(&#39;Screen&#39;, params)</code></td>\n<td>强制推入新的栈帧（始终创建新实例）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>navigation.replace(&#39;Screen&#39;, params)</code></td>\n<td>替换当前屏幕（不可返回）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>navigation.goBack()</code></td>\n<td>返回上一屏幕</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>navigation.popToTop()</code></td>\n<td>返回栈底</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>navigation.setParams(params)</code></td>\n<td>更新当前屏幕的路由参数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"导航性能优化\">导航性能优化</h2><h3 id=\"懒加载屏幕\">懒加载屏幕</h3><p>Tab Navigator 默认在用户首次访问时渲染 Tab 内容。对于首次打开应用不需要立即显示的 Tab，可以延迟加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;Tab.Navigator&gt;&#10;  &lt;Tab.Screen&#10;    name=&quot;Home&quot;&#10;    component={HomeScreen}&#10;    // initialParams 不影响懒加载行为&#10;  /&gt;&#10;  &lt;Tab.Screen&#10;    name=&quot;Messages&quot;&#10;    component={MessagesScreen}&#10;    // Messages tab 在首次点击时才渲染&#10;  /&gt;&#10;&lt;/Tab.Navigator&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tab.Navigator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tab.Screen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Home\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{HomeScreen}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // initialParams 不影响懒加载行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tab.Screen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Messages\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{MessagesScreen}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Messages tab 在首次点击时才渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tab.Navigator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>React Navigation 6 的 Tab Navigator 默认已是懒加载（<code>lazy: true</code>），首屏只渲染第一个 Tab，避免了应用启动时初始化全部 Tab 的开销。</p>\n<h3 id=\"避免不必要的重渲染\">避免不必要的重渲染</h3><p>导航状态变化时，<code>NavigationContainer</code> 会触发所有使用 <code>useNavigation</code> 的组件重渲染。优化策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 每次导航状态变化都重渲染&#10;function Header() {&#10;  const navigation = useNavigation();&#10;  const route = useRoute();&#10;  return &lt;Text&gt;{route.name}&lt;/Text&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 只读取需要的特定状态&#10;function Header() {&#10;  const routeName = useNavigationState(&#10;    state =&gt; state.routes[state.index].name&#10;  );&#10;  return &lt;Text&gt;{routeName}&lt;/Text&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 每次导航状态变化都重渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> navigation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useNavigation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> route</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{route.name}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 只读取需要的特定状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routeName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useNavigationState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.routes[state.index].name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{routeName}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>useNavigationState</code> 接受一个选择器函数，只有选择器返回值变化时才触发重渲染，类似 Redux 的 <code>useSelector</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"deep-linking-配置\">Deep Linking 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const linking = {&#10;  prefixes: [&#39;myapp://&#39;, &#39;https://myapp.com&#39;],&#10;  config: {&#10;    screens: {&#10;      MainTabs: {&#10;        screens: {&#10;          Profile: &#39;profile&#39;,&#10;          Search: {&#10;            path: &#39;search&#39;,&#10;            parse: {&#10;              initialQuery: (query: string) =&gt; decodeURIComponent(query),&#10;            },&#10;          },&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;      UserProfile: &#39;user/:userId&#39;,&#10;      PhotoViewer: {&#10;        path: &#39;photo/:initialIndex&#39;,&#10;        parse: {&#10;          initialIndex: Number,&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;&lt;NavigationContainer linking={linking} fallback={&lt;LoadingScreen /&gt;}&gt;&#10;  &lt;RootNavigator /&gt;&#10;&lt;/NavigationContainer&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linking</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prefixes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myapp://'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://myapp.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  config: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    screens: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      MainTabs: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        screens: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          Profile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'profile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          Search: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            parse: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">              initialQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decodeURIComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      UserProfile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user/:userId'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      PhotoViewer: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'photo/:initialIndex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        parse: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          initialIndex: Number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">NavigationContainer linking</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{linking} fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;LoadingScreen />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RootNavigator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">NavigationContainer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置完成后，<code>myapp://user/123</code> 会直接打开 <code>UserProfileScreen</code> 并传入 <code>userId: &#39;123&#39;</code>，<code>https://myapp.com/search?initialQuery=react</code> 会打开搜索屏幕并预填查询词。</p>\n<p>关于在屏幕间传递复杂状态（超出路由参数范围的数据）的处理方式，参见 <a href=\"state-data-management\">状态与数据管理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>React Navigation 6 的设计哲学是<strong>把原生导航原语暴露给 JavaScript</strong>，而不是在 JS 层模拟导航行为。底部 Tab、原生 Stack、全屏 Modal 都通过真正的原生 API 实现，保证了与系统手势（iOS 边缘返回、Android 系统返回键）的兼容性。</p>\n<p>类型安全的路由参数是生产应用的标配——定义 <code>ParamList</code> 类型后，TypeScript 会在编译时检查导航调用是否传入了正确的参数，杜绝了屏幕间参数传递不一致导致的运行时错误。Deep Linking 的声明式配置也使 Universal Links 和 Push Notification 的跳转处理变得可维护。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"React Navigation：导航与路由体系","id":"react-navigation-导航与路由体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"React Navigation 的导航器组合","id":"react-navigation-的导航器组合"},{"level":2,"text":"类型安全的路由参数","id":"类型安全的路由参数"},{"level":2,"text":"导航性能优化","id":"导航性能优化"},{"level":3,"text":"懒加载屏幕","id":"懒加载屏幕"},{"level":3,"text":"避免不必要的重渲染","id":"避免不必要的重渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"Deep Linking 配置","id":"deep-linking-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Native 组件模式与复用策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/core-development/component-patterns"},"next":{"title":"React Native 状态与数据管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/core-development/state-data-management"}}